        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Girl's dress of mauve silk with a narrow white stripe in the weave, the bodice and sleeves lined with white cotton and the hem with undyed canvas.  The bodice has a square neck and puffed sleeves and is gauged just above the waist at front and back; the skirt is pleated into the waist and has two patch pockets at the front.  The hem is finished with a double frill of self fabric; the neck, sleeves, pockets and frills are edged with narrow black velvet ribbon.  The garment fastens at the back of the bodice with a black silk loop and matching covered button, and with four hooks and eyes."@en ;
